-- 2026-11-19: Spotlight reel v3 notes and the standing collaboration rule (playbook ve-podcast-studio). Safe to run twice.
insert into playbook_records (slug, brand_slug, author, body, source, kind, created_at)
select 've-podcast-studio', 'vegans-explore', 'Logan', $b$Spotlight format, Sean 2026-11-19, v3 notes and the standing rule. Reel notes: lo-fi beds ("hipper music... the type of music we make, like more lo-fi"), no camera cut to Sean inside a guest's clip (picture ends before it, last frame held while the word finishes), the end card is no longer a text card ("kind of bland at the end... we kind of lose it"): the close shows their real Vegans Explore profile page in the window with a slow push-in, the band "The Vegans Explore Podcast · Episode N, now live." (no date: the reel plays the Monday after the episode), a plate with where to find them and the orange vegansexplore.com button. Veronica's clip moved to 13:53 to 14:36 (her son is in frame for most of the interview; Sean: "It may not be cute to everybody"). STANDING RULE (Sean): "Anytime we want to do these features, we reach out to them ahead of time to confirm the collaboration": an email asking if they would like to collaborate on the post, and if there is anything they would like adjusted, we are happy to work with them. First: An (Sen Saigon), reel live Monday Nov 23 after Ep 147.$b$, 'text', 'decision', now()
where not exists (select 1 from playbook_records where slug='ve-podcast-studio' and body like 'Spotlight format, Sean 2026-11-19, v3%');
